# Build context exclusions for both docker/Dockerfile.api and
# docker/Dockerfile.dashboard (context: .. in docker-compose.yml).
#
# Leading slashes anchor these to the context root -- .dockerignore follows
# .gitignore matching rules, where an unanchored `data/` would also match
# src/dashboard/data/ (which holds replay_flows.json, needed for the
# dashboard build) and silently break it.
#
# /docs/ is excluded explicitly, not left to "implicit" COPY selectivity:
# it holds Master_Architecture_Document.md, the private strategic document
# (gitignored, but still present on disk locally). Neither Dockerfile ever
# COPYs docs/, but that only controls the final image layers -- the build
# CONTEXT (everything under `context: ..` not excluded here) is tarred and
# sent to the Docker daemon before any COPY filtering happens.
/docs/

/.git/
/venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/.pytest_cache/

/data/
/notebooks/

src/dashboard/node_modules/
src/dashboard/.next/

.DS_Store
